00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:13.240
it comes out extra fluffy.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:16.240
Then you mix in a
beaten egg and fry it right away,

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:19.460
the result is fried rice
that's fluffy throughout.

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:21.080
I see.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.380
This flavour...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.510
What is this delicious flavour?

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:30.260
It has a meaty taste to it.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:31.970
Chicken Soup?

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:34.470
No! These eggs are...

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.140
Shamo Chicken Eggs, aren't they?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.560
Shamo Chicken Eggs?

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.980
Yes. He's really outdone himself this time.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:48.070
Shamo Chickens only lay a small number of eggs
It's said that even the egg whites are delectable.

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.110
And the chicken soup he used...

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:54.780
I see what you did here.

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:59.750
That's quite clever, Ishigami-kun.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.710
He used Shamo Chicken eggs
and Shamo Chicken broth.

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:13.840
[Oya - Parent (Chicken) | Ko - Child (Egg)]
It's a sort of Shamo Chicken Oyako Fried Rice.

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.550
No, those are store-bought eggs.

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.680
And the soup came out of a can.

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.180
But you smiled!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.190
If I was wrong, why did you smile?!

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:25.860
I was just wondering what
the hell you were going on about.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.570
You're so mean, Ishigami-kun!

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:31.860
Your punches don't really do much, you know.

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:35.820
And stop talking nonsense.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.740
<i>She's still eating?!</i>

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.200
<i>Doesn't she get full?</i>

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.040
Results

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.170
Huh? Miko-chan, what's wrong?

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:55.380
Wha... Why only one point?

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.680
Was it that bad?

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.010
I never said it was bad.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.640
Why, then?

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:10.440
It was delicious, but
she was too embarrassed to say so!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.860
Why did you say it loud?!

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:20.120
See, I knew he'd make that face!
This is why I didn't want to say it!

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.120
I guess I'm last then.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.080
How cute!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.160
This is...

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.580
Golden Fried Rice!

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.880
This is all you need for fried rice.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:32.670
Heat up oil in a sizzling hot frying pan.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.300
Quickly add in the beaten egg and rice.

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.140
Shake the pan gently while
stirring it with the ladle.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.550
That's all.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.560
Here goes nothing.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:02.450
Tears?

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.330
Is it really that delicious?

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:09.080
This fried rice recipe isn't something
you can just come up with in a day.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.960
Onii, is dinner ready?

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:12.630
Almost done.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:13.210
You must have made it over
and over again since you were small.
Almost done.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:15.050
Son, is dinner ready?
You must have made it over
and over again since you were small.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:15.090
You must have made it over
and over again since you were small.

00:21:15.090 --> 00:21:15.920
Do it yourself!
You must have made it over
and over again since you were small.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.340
Do it yourself!

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:18.550
Many times...

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.550
Repeated it so many times...

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:35.190
This is the result of all that.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:40.450
When I think of you toiling time after time
on this poor man's fried rice,

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.450
I can't help but recall your
difficult financial situation.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:46.370
So sad...

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.000
That's why you're crying...

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.710
Also, don't call it "Poor Man's Fried Rice"!

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.460
You poor thing...

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.210
Don't look at me like that!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:58.170
Frankly, the flavour is about the
same as Ishigami-kun's,

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:00.800
but I think we should
give the President the win.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.470
That doesn't make me happy!

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:04.050
Congratulations.

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:05.600
We totally lost, President.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:08.850
The flavour!
Tell me how it tastes, damn it!!

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:12.690
You've had a difficult life, but you've studied hard.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.520
Results of Today's Fried Rice Cook-Off

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:16.690
Shirogane's victory

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:17.990
Thank you for the meal.

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:20.740
The president's fried rice!

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:24.370
In the end, the contestants
all bought bread for lunch,

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:26.450
And Iino packed on a few pounds.

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:28.290
"Now then, time for lunch."

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:29.870
What a foodie!
"Now then, time for lunch."

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:30.910
"Now then, time for lunch."
